<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Avgold's ETC Q2 gold sales rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Avgold's ETC Q2 gold sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Capital spending	     5.12   vs 2.46</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		86,938   vs 88,670</p>
<p>    Gold sold (kg)		  798   vs 666</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		 9.18   vs 7.52</p>
<p>    Cash cost (rand/kg)	47,705   vs 49,532</p>
<p>    Total cost (rand/kg)     56,086   vs 56,949</p>
<p>Full name: Eastern Transvaal Consolidated division of Avgold Ltd</p>
